Supplemental notices for the prebundled Tesseract.js 7.0.0 browser worker

The published dist/worker.min.js.map identifies the nine modules listed below
as embedded worker dependencies. Their versions are taken from the Tesseract.js
v7.0.0 source lockfile, not from a later install of its semver dependency ranges:
https://github.com/naptha/tesseract.js/blob/v7.0.0/package-lock.json

The SDK uses the copied browser worker directly. This supplement describes that
worker, not Tesseract.js's Node.js factory or its unused Node-only dependency
graph. In particular, node-fetch and tr46 are not inventoried as bundled browser
worker components. The Tesseract.js package license and the original
worker.min.js.LICENSE.txt sidecar are supplied separately.

The full original license files below supplement that sidecar, which does not
contain complete license texts for every identified module. This is source-map
and source-lock provenance, not a reproducible build or a complete binary SBOM.

